      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "In this game, players are immersed in a fascinating world where they need
    to show their creativity and strategic thinking! Your task is to guide the ball
    from its starting position to the cup using the lines you draw on the screen.\r                      
    \n\n- Line Drawing: With a simple touch, you can draw lines of different lengths
    and shapes, creating a path for the ball. Lines can be straight or curved, and
    can also include various elements such as ups and downs.\r \n\n- Physics: The
    game uses realistic physics, so the ball will roll along your lines, reacting
    to slopes and other factors. You need to take gravity and inertia into account
    to design the path correctly.                       "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e21d9fa883341484f8393b51730ca170, type: 2}
